<title>USA: MSU Corp gets $3.1 mln order.</title>
<headline>MSU Corp gets $3.1 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>MSU Corp said on Thursday it has received an order from Vision Link Telecommunications Inc to purchase $3.1 million of MSU's Internet Access Device during 1996.</p>
<p>MSU said it forecasts a further $31.6 million orders during 1997.</p>
<p>The execution of the order is subject to the approval of final production samples, the company said.</p>
<p>Vision Link Telecommunications Inc. is a privately owned trading company operating from Fairfield, Ohio.</p>
